	(text "U2 (hardware/gal/ecb_sd_decode.pld):\n  SEL = A7..A4 = 1100 & IORQ* & M1* high & EN\n  SELRD / SELWR = SEL & RD* / WR*    BUF_OE_N = SEL & (RD*|WR*)\n  WAIT* pulled low (open-drain emulation) while SEL & !ACK\nACK has a pull-up: with no Pico running the card never holds WAIT."
